  "faqItem1Q": "How to create a new city report?",
  "faqItem1A": "Go to \"Create Report\", fill all required fields, optionally attach photos/videos, choose a category, and tap \"Save as Report\" or \"Save as Draft\".",
  "faqItem2Q": "Can I edit submitted reports?",
  "faqItem2A": "No, submitted reports cannot be edited. Only drafts can be edited before submission.",
  "faqItem3Q": "What if my report is rejected?",
  "faqItem3A": "Rejected reports cannot be changed or deleted. You can create a new report with correct information.",
  "faqItem4Q": "How to delete a draft?",
  "faqItem4A": "On the Drafts page, select the draft and tap \"Delete\". Drafts can be deleted anytime before submission.",
  "faqItem5Q": "Can I delete a report after submission?",
  "faqItem5A": "Reports can be deleted only if status is \"Not Reviewed\". Once \"Under Review\", \"Approved\", or \"Rejected\", deletion is disabled.",
  "faqItem6Q": "How to check the status of my report?",
  "faqItem6A": "Each report has a status: \"Not Reviewed\", \"Under Review\", \"Approved\", or \"Rejected\". Status is visible in the report list and details.",
  "faqItem7Q": "Can I attach photos or videos to a report?",
  "faqItem7A": "Yes, use the \"Attach Proof\" button when creating a report.",
  "faqItem8Q": "How to change the app language?",
  "faqItem8A": "Use the language switcher 🌐 on the login/registration screen. Supported languages: EN, RU, KZ.",
  "faqItem9Q": "What if I find a bug or app problem?",
  "faqItem9A": "Go to the Support section in the bottom-left corner and submit a message through the contact form.",
  "faqItem10Q": "Can I use the app without registration?",
  "faqItem10A": "No, you must log in to create reports and manage drafts."
